  },
  "regions": [
    {
      "region_idx": 0,
      "first_idx": 0,
      "last_idx": 29,
      "text": "Four score and seven years ago our fathers brought forth on this continent a new nation, conceived in Liberty, and dedicated to the proposition that all men are created equal.",
      "n_words": 30,
      "n_aligned": 30,
      "start": 0.98,
      "end": 10.961,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.006,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.249
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 1,
      "first_idx": 30,
      "last_idx": 53,
      "text": "Now we are engaged in a great civil war, testing whether that nation, or any nation so conceived and so dedicated, can long endure.",
      "n_words": 24,
      "n_aligned": 24,
      "start": 11.522,
      "end": 18.962,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.226,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.687
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 2,
      "first_idx": 54,
      "last_idx": 63,
      "text": "We are met on a great battlefield of that war.",
      "n_words": 10,
      "n_aligned": 10,
      "start": 19.443,
      "end": 21.703,
      "speech_rate_wps": 4.425,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 6.173
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 3,
      "first_idx": 64,
      "last_idx": 90,
      "text": "We have come to dedicate a portion of that field as a final resting place for those who here gave their lives that that nation might live.",
      "n_words": 27,
      "n_aligned": 27,
      "start": 22.323,
      "end": 29.944,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.543,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.769
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 4,
      "first_idx": 91,
      "last_idx": 101,
      "text": "It is altogether fitting and proper that we should do this.",
      "n_words": 11,
      "n_aligned": 11,
      "start": 30.464,
      "end": 33.164,
      "speech_rate_wps": 4.074,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.955
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 5,
      "first_idx": 102,
      "last_idx": 117,
      "text": "But, in a larger sense, we cannot dedicate, we cannot consecrate, we cannot hallow this ground.",
      "n_words": 16,
      "n_aligned": 16,
      "start": 33.724,
      "end": 39.525,
      "speech_rate_wps": 2.758,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.187
    }
  ],
